{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212180","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121218001:0":{"text":"容赦のないお嬢ちゃんだ。さすがはミス・クロガネの娘ってとこか？こりゃ、肋骨の二、三本はいっちまったかな。","source_cn":"这姑娘下手可真狠，不愧是黑金女士的女儿，我的肋骨可能断...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD271C890C7277FED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121218002:1":{"text":"本当にあの人の娘なんでしょうか？だって、彼女のあの羽……","source_cn":"她真是那人的女儿吗？你们仔细看她的翅膀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA08AF576BB545B11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121218003:1":{"text":"うーん……確かにミス・クロガネとはあまり似てないな。","source_cn":"嗯……从外貌来看，确实和黑金女士不怎么像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x433B33BF39BFD8D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1121218003":{"text":"うーん……確かにミス・クロガネとはあまり似てないな。","source_cn":"嗯……从外貌来看，确实和黑金女士不怎么像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x433B33BF39BFD8D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121218004:0":{"text":"ババリアには詳しくありませんが、彼女の華奢な体型は、ババリアというより……","source_cn":"我对蛮血部落的了解不算特别多，但她的身形纤细轻盈，不太像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DFDEB9B4D419071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_m